description	"EVO Environmental Trooper

Lightning Charged Elite Infantry with strong crowd control and Anti-Jedi Synergy.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee Specials
-- Pulse/Cripple On Hit
- Stun Baton (2)
- SE-14C Blaster Pistol (1)
- FC-1 Flechette Launcher (2)
-- Based On Shotgun
-- Pulses/Stuns On Hit
-- 15% Slower Movement
-- Mag Reload, 2 Shots
-- 75%- Damage
-- 80%- RoF
- Arc Lightning Thrower
-- Applies Force Focus
- Pulse Grenades (2)

^3Powers:
- Lightning Burst (Lightning 2)
-- Applies Force Focus

^8Attributes:
- Environmental Protection (2)
- 100% Slower Cooldowns
- Blast Armour
- Magnetic Plating

^8Abilities:
- Shockfield Generator ^3[CS1]
- Shockwave Burst ^3[CS2]
- Wrist Pulse Laser ^3[CS3]
-- Pulses, Low Damage
- Cloak (1) ^3[CS4]"
